  "id": "02-followthrough-candle-adverse-20261006-web",
  "title": "Follow-through candle: conditional adverse movement",
  "summary": "Saved candle geometry estimates condition on eventual same-direction closes. Corrected complete-leg duration is a raw clock proxy; neither result is a live entry filter.",
  "publishedAt": "2026-10-06T23:09:36Z",
  "source": {
    "producer": "sahadeva",
