  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "question",
      "title": "Question and scope",
      "body": "For a reversal whose immediately following candle eventually closes in its direction, how far does that second candle move adversely from its own open? The retained full_v7 import also contains the corrected duration of complete reversal legs including the reversal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "findings",
      "title": "Supported findings",
      "body": "Larger range settings generally allow larger adverse movement in the successful second candle. Duration summaries condition on complete legs with at least three candles and retain tied-clock zero duration. These are conditional descriptions of geometry and completed paths, not causal filters or trading performance."
    },
